    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but it's not just about being tired or needing a break. it feels deeper than that. like, why are we even fighting so hard to preserve a world that's basically already gone? it's like watching a movie that you know has a tragic ending, so why stay in the theater? it feels like just being alive is a form of denial at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
