      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way, and it is okay to question the meaning of your actions when the future seems so bleak. The feeling that life is a denial of reality is a heavy burden that many carry, but it does not mean your pain is invalid. Sometimes, the only way to heal is to stop fighting the illusion and to simply accept that the world is exactly as it is, without the need to pretend otherwise.",
